{"1890350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greed Hunters", "steam_appid": 1890350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A PART OF COMMUNITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/301cf920127c5e86e3194771e55584d5.avif?t=1771643815\" width=594 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the ultimate dungeon experience!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/6eabc2903b6517c564cd56a79d14ba67.poster.avif?t=1771643815\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/6eabc2903b6517c564cd56a79d14ba67.webm?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/6eabc2903b6517c564cd56a79d14ba67.mp4?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of chaos and bullets with our thrilling new multiplayer rogue-like game! With up to 8 player online and LAN co-op, you can join forces with friends to battle through randomly generated dungeons filled with danger and mystery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER MANY UNIQUE WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Keyboards to guns and everything in between, <u>Greed Hunters</u> features a wide variety of unique weapons for you to discover. Each weapon has its own strengths and weaknesses, allowing you to tailor your gameplay experience to your liking. So whether you prefer up-close and personal combat or long-range sniping, we've got you covered.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/21e8b5805a4016dfaf082d45312ea064.apng?t=1771643815\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/21e8b5805a4016dfaf082d45312ea064.poster.avif?t=1771643815\" class=\"bb_img\" width=594 height=207 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomly Generated Dungeons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With infinite seeded dungeon generation possibilities, no two playthroughs will ever be the same. Explore new environments, battle new enemies, and uncover new secrets with every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greed System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item you pick up has a potential curse that can make your journey more difficult. However, delivering the cursed items to the Greed Dealer can net you valuable rewards. The worse the curse, the better the reward. But beware, the Greed Dealer is a mysterious figure with his own motives. Will you take the risk and trade in cursed items for rewards, or play it safe? The choice is yours in our ultimate dungeon bullet hell experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/e108c3ba0b9ae45b6e5aca4444871b54.poster.avif?t=1771643815\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/e108c3ba0b9ae45b6e5aca4444871b54.webm?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/e108c3ba0b9ae45b6e5aca4444871b54.mp4?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lan/On-line Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends for the ultimate multiplayer experience. Whether you're playing online or on LAN, our co-op mode lets you work together to take down the toughest enemies and conquer the deadliest dungeons.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer to play with a gamepad? No problem! Our game supports controllers, so you can play however you like.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE HAVE CAPYBARAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes that's everything on this point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to explore the ultimate dungeon bullet hell experience? Grab your friends and get ready for a wild ride. Play now and see if you have what it takes to make it out alive!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A PART OF COMMUNITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/301cf920127c5e86e3194771e55584d5.avif?t=1771643815\" width=594 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the ultimate dungeon experience!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/6eabc2903b6517c564cd56a79d14ba67.poster.avif?t=1771643815\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/6eabc2903b6517c564cd56a79d14ba67.webm?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/6eabc2903b6517c564cd56a79d14ba67.mp4?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of chaos and bullets with our thrilling new multiplayer rogue-like game! With up to 8 player online and LAN co-op, you can join forces with friends to battle through randomly generated dungeons filled with danger and mystery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER MANY UNIQUE WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Keyboards to guns and everything in between, <u>Greed Hunters</u> features a wide variety of unique weapons for you to discover. Each weapon has its own strengths and weaknesses, allowing you to tailor your gameplay experience to your liking. So whether you prefer up-close and personal combat or long-range sniping, we've got you covered.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/21e8b5805a4016dfaf082d45312ea064.apng?t=1771643815\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/21e8b5805a4016dfaf082d45312ea064.poster.avif?t=1771643815\" class=\"bb_img\" width=594 height=207 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomly Generated Dungeons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With infinite seeded dungeon generation possibilities, no two playthroughs will ever be the same. Explore new environments, battle new enemies, and uncover new secrets with every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greed System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item you pick up has a potential curse that can make your journey more difficult. However, delivering the cursed items to the Greed Dealer can net you valuable rewards. The worse the curse, the better the reward. But beware, the Greed Dealer is a mysterious figure with his own motives. Will you take the risk and trade in cursed items for rewards, or play it safe? The choice is yours in our ultimate dungeon bullet hell experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/e108c3ba0b9ae45b6e5aca4444871b54.poster.avif?t=1771643815\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/e108c3ba0b9ae45b6e5aca4444871b54.webm?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890350/extras/e108c3ba0b9ae45b6e5aca4444871b54.mp4?t=1771643815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lan/On-line Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends for the ultimate multiplayer experience. Whether you're playing online or on LAN, our co-op mode lets you work together to take down the toughest enemies and conquer the deadliest dungeons.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer to play with a gamepad? No problem! Our game supports controllers, so you can play however you like.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE HAVE CAPYBARAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes that's everything on this point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to explore the ultimate dungeon bullet hell experience? Grab your friends and get ready for a wild ride. Play now and see if you have what it takes to make it out alive!</h2>", "short_description": "Collect artefacts. Trade them for power. Betray your friends. Greed Hunters is a chaotic roguelike for up to 8 players, where even the worst artifacts fuel your rise to dominance.",